00:38:40.450 --> 00:38:44.750
<v Eric Hayot>And then on the tape, there'd be this-- "Tsung, xie, xie, tsung, xie, xie, tsung."
<v Eric Hayot>然后磁带里会有这种声音——“锵，些，些，锵，些，些，锵。”

00:38:44.750 --> 00:39:10.880
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life .
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

